      "comments": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49996275",
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how benchmark evaluations can move beyond verbal fluency to grounded physical engineering. You will learn how models are tested on co-designing simulated robots and competitive strategies in an open-ended physics arena.",
      "authors": [
        "Kushagra Tiwary",
        "David Mayo",
