      "why_read": "This post explains how viewing transformer multi-layer perceptrons as Hebbian memories enables closed-form, training-free factual storage at optimal capacity. Readers will gain a clear mechanistic mental model for how factual knowledge can be directly embedded and edited inside transformers.",
